display the target's definition location, hover docs, and signature

Usage:
  gopls [flags] inspect [inspect-flags] <target>

Example:
	$ gopls inspect -pkg go/ast Decl
	$ gopls inspect golang.org/x/tools/go/ast/inspector.Cursor

inspect-flags:
  -json
    	emit output in JSON format
  -markdown
    	outputs documentation in formatted Markdown instead of plain text
  -pkg=string
    	scopes the query to a specific package, resolving ambiguities in versioned package paths (for example, gopkg.in/yaml.v3) or vanity domains.
  -pos=string
    	targets a physical coordinate range (line and column are optional)
